        {
          "text": "Elyo Davida wakati, Taakwe beelede kuyumuna ibbokesi lya-Leza cita ba-Levi luzutu, nkaambo mbombabo Jehova mbaakasala kuti bayumune ibbokesi lya-Leza akumumanina milimo lyoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
