        {
          "text": "Nkabela Davida wakayobolola ba-Israyeli boonse ku-Jerusalemu kuti balonzye ibbokesi lya-Jehova kuya kubusena bwalyo mbwaakalibambilide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.3",
