        {
          "text": "wakabaambila kuti, Ndinywe basilutwe banzubo zyaba-Levi. Amulisalazye akusalazya bakwanu, kuti mulonzye ibbokesi lya-Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli kuya oko nkundalibambila. ",
