        {
          "text": "Kukutaanguna teensi ndinywe mwakaliyumuna, aboobo Jehova Leza wesu wakatusotokela, nkaambo teetwakalibamba muciyanza ceelede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.13",
