        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi Davida wakalailila basilutwe baba-Levi kuti babike bamwi bakwabo kuti babe basikwiimba abasikulizya zibulo zyakwiimya, nyeele atuntimbwa azigweele, akusekelela loko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.16",
