        },
        {
          "text": "Aboobo Davida abapati ba-Israyeli abasilutwe bazyuulu bakaakuleta ibbokesi lyacizuminano ca-Jehova kuzwa kuŋanda ya-Obedi-Bdomu, bali mukusekelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
