        {
          "text": "Lino ibbokesi lyacizuminano ca-Jehova lisike buyo kumunzi wa-Davida, Mikala mwana musimbi wa-Saulo wakasondela kucimboni, wabona Davida ulazyana akusekelela, elyo wakamusampaula mumoyo wakwe.",
